STEP 4: /old/ Directory Enumeration
-----------------------------------
Goal: Discover files in the backup directory.

Command:
ffuf -u https://medirozahospital.com/old/FUZZ \
     -w /usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt \
     -e .sql,.bak,.backup,.gz,.zip -t 5 -p 1.0 -fc 404,403,429 -c

